   $q$How does the final paragraph develop the consequences of the change in attribution?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Losing a famous name led the museum to move the painting into storage out of public view.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Losing a famous name gave the painting new appeal as a puzzle, drawing visitors to its story.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The new attribution identified the real artist, whose fame soon matched Ferrant's own.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The newspaper story damaged the museum's reputation until the exhibit restored public trust.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Losing a famous name gave the painting new appeal as a puzzle, drawing visitors to its story.$q$, $q$The last paragraph notes rising attendance, an exhibit about the investigation, and Abadi's remark that the painting became "more interesting as a puzzle." The artist is still listed as unknown, so no new name was identified.$q$, 'draft', '61d06bc3-f6c7-5207-83b7-199fe7ce9908')
